od_Rowland","sentences":[{"en":"Frank Sherwood \"Sherry\" Rowland (June 28, 1927 – March 10, 2012) was an American Nobel Prize-winning chemist.","tr":"Frank Sherwood \"Sherry\" Rowland (28 Haziran 1927 – 10 Mart 2012), Nobel Ödülü kazanmış Amerikalı bir kimyagerdi."},{"en":"He was a professor of chemistry at the University of California, Irvine.","tr":"Irvine'deki California Üniversitesi'nde kimya profesörüydü."},{"en":"His research was on atmospheric chemistry and chemical kinetics.","tr":"Araştırmaları atmosfer kimyası ve kimyasal kinetik üzerineydi."},{"en":"His best-known work was the discovery that chlorofluorocarbons role in ozone depletion.","tr":"En iyi bilinen çalışması, kloroflorokarbonların ozon tabakasının incelmesindeki rolünü keşfetmesiydi."},{"en":"He won the 1995 Nobel Prize in Chemistry with Mario Molina and Paul J.","tr":"1995 Nobel Kimya Ödülü'nü Mario Molina ve Paul J. ile birlikte kazandı."}]},{"title":"List of Bangla Academy Literary Award winners (2010s)","slug":"List_of_Bangla_Academy_Literary_Award_winners_(2010s)","sentences":[{"en":"Bangla Academy Literary Award is given by Bangla Academy for contribution in the field of Bengali language and literature.","tr":"Bangla Academy Edebiyat Ödülü, Bengal dili ve edebiyatına katkılarından dolayı Bangla Academy tarafından verilir."},{"en":"In the list below, the winner of the award for each year from 2010 to 2019 is given.","tr":"Aşağıdaki listede, 2010'dan 2019'a kadar her yılın ödül kazananı verilmiştir."}]},{"title":"Dany Heatley","slug":"Dany_Heatley","sentences":[{"en":"Daniel James Heatley (born January 21, 1981) was a German-born Canadian former professional ice hockey right winger.","tr":"Daniel James Heatley (21 Ocak 1981 doğumlu), Almanya doğumlu Kanadalı eski bir profesyonel buz hokeyi sağ kanat oyuncusuydu."},{"en":"He played parts of thirteen seasons in the National Hockey League (NHL).","tr":"National Hockey League'de (NHL) on üç sezonun bazı bölümlerinde forma giydi."},{"en":"He played for the Atlanta Thrashers, Ottawa Senators, San Jose Sharks, Minnesota Wild, and Anaheim Ducks.","tr":"Atlanta Thrashers, Ottawa Senators, San Jose Sharks, Minnesota Wild ve Anaheim Ducks takımlarında oynadı."},{"en":"He also played for SC Bern of the National League A (NLA) and for Ak Bars Kazan of the Russian Superleague (RSL), and the Thomas Sabo Ice Tigers of the Deutsche Eishockey Liga (DEL).","tr":"Ayrıca National League A'nın (NLA) SC Bern takımında, Rusya Süper Ligi'nin (RSL) Ak Bars Kazan takımında ve Deutsche Eishockey Liga'nın (DEL) Thomas Sabo Ice Tigers takımında oynadı."},{"en":"He won the trophy when he was playing for the Atlanta Thrashers.","tr":"Kupayı Atlanta Thrashers'ta oynarken kazandı."}]},{"title":"Cassie Lang","slug":"Cassie_Lang","sentences":[{"en":"Cassandra Eleanor \"Cassie\" Lang is a fictional character in the Marvel Comics universe, and later becomes a superheroine under the aliases Stature and Stinger.","tr":"Cassandra Eleanor \"Cassie\" Lang, Marvel Comics evreninde kurgusal bir karakterdir ve daha sonra Stature ve Stinger takma adlarıyla bir kadın süper kahramana dönüşür."},{"en":"She is the daughter of Scott Lang and Peggy Rae, with the former being the successor superhero of Hank Pym's mantle, Ant-Man, and later becomes his partner.","tr":"Scott Lang ve Peggy Rae'nin kızıdır; babası Scott Lang, Hank Pym'in Ant-Man kimliğini devralan süper kahramandır ve Cassie daha sonra onun ortağı olur."},{"en":"Cassandra Lang was created by David Michelinie and John Byrne, and first appeared in Marvel Premiere #47 in April of 1979.","tr":"Cassandra Lang, David Michelinie ve John Byrne tarafından yaratıldı ve Nisan 1979'da Marvel Premiere #47'de ilk kez göründü."}]},{"title":"Greater Dhaka","slug":"Greater_Dhaka","sentences":[{"en":"Greater Dhaka refers to the larger city area around Dhaka, the capital of Bangladesh.","tr":"Greater Dhaka, Bangladeş'in başkenti Dhaka çevresindeki daha geniş kentsel alanı ifade eder."},{"en":"It has evolved into one of the biggest cities globally and is rising at an incredible pace.","tr":"Dünyanın en büyük şehirlerinden birine dönüşmüş ve inanılmaz bir hızla büyümektedir."},{"en":"In 2001, the Dhaka Metropolitan Area was 1,353 square kilometers, with Dhaka City covering 276 square kilometers.","tr":"2001'de Dhaka Metropolitan Area 1.353 kilometrekareydi; Dhaka City ise 276 kilometrekarelik bir alanı kaplıyordu."},{"en":"The metropolitan area includes parts of Dhaka District, such as Savar and Keraniganj, Narayanganj District, which contains Narayanganj Sadar, Bandar, and Rupganj, and Gazipur District with Gazipur Sadar and Kaliakair.","tr":"Metropoliten alan, Savar ve Keraniganj gibi Dhaka District'in bazı bölümlerini; Narayanganj Sadar, Bandar ve Rupganj'ı içeren Narayanganj District'i; ayrıca Gazipur Sadar ve Kaliakair'i kapsayan Gazipur District'i içerir."},{"en":"Estimated by the Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics in 2021, the population of the three districts is over 24 million.","tr":"Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics'in 2021 tahminine göre üç ilçenin nüfusu 24 milyonun üzerindedir."}]},{"title":"American University of the Caribbean","slug":"American_University_of_the_Caribbean","sentences":[{"en":"The American University of the Caribbean School of Medicine (AUC) is a private medical school.","tr":"American University of the Caribbean School of Medicine (AUC), özel bir tıp fakültesidir."},{"en":"Its main campus is in Sint Maarten with some offices in Miramar, Florida.","tr":"Ana kampüsü Sint Maarten'de, bazı ofisleri ise Florida'daki Miramar'dadır."}]},{"title":"Anastasia Romanovna","slug":"Anastasia_Romanovna","sentences":[{"en":"Anastasia Romanovna was the wife of Ivan the Terrible, the tsar of Russia from the 25th of August 1530 to the 28th of March 1584.","tr":"Anastasia Romanovna, 25 Ağustos 1530'dan 28 Mart 1584'e kadar Rusya çarı olan Ivan the Terrible'ın eşiydi."},{"en":"She was the daughter of Roman Yurievich Zakharyin and was born in the year 1530 and died in 